  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.10: adds HttpByteRange.ParseSingle - the shared RFC 7233 byte-range parser used by the web-seed servers (clamps over-EOF range ends, 416 for unsatisfiable, suffix ranges, 64-bit lengths). Fixes a 206 over-promise that surfaced as net::ERR_CONTENT_LENGTH_MISMATCH on web-seed piece fetches. Client behavior unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md.",
